        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-OfDWdxCeQoWiUSxoleylMJ5HgNg\"><strong><em>The chart below shows the proportion of survey respondents that showed interest in particular sports in the UK. Summarise the information by selecting, reporting the main features, and make comparison where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "listen_from": -1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Sports Interest in the UK</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Idea cho Overview:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QEeEdHIN4ofkwNxCkILl0889gfh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5xEdvXIaowy0GxL2a2lB2jfgid\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjmOdwvzzowAdLxFQUElrTUagrd\">\n<div>\n<div>Khi viết overview cho số liệu c&oacute; thay đổi qua thời gian trong đề Sports Interest in the UK, <strong>team academic IELTS 1984</strong><strong> </strong>ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung v&agrave;o <strong>trend (xu hướng) </strong>v&agrave; <strong>differences (sự kh&aacute;c biệt)</strong><strong>.</strong></div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VS7cd65kEoOvVIxgkPClryMlg1e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trend:</strong> <strong>Football, Swimming, v&agrave; Rugby</strong> đều ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng trở n&ecirc;n được y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch, trong khi đ&oacute;, <strong>Snooker, Tennis, v&agrave; Golf </strong>trở n&ecirc;n &iacute;t được y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DXu0d5zwKoZ2vrxxmCBlBKNpgog\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences:</strong><strong> Football </strong>l&agrave; m&ocirc;n thể thao được y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch nhất ở cả 3 năm.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> C&aacute;ch ph&acirc;n chia BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XibGdxfRGovZX4xmloNlYRnWgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2aHdRosAoJyFhxEEwSlHZ0cgsb\">Với bar chart đề Sports Interest in the UK n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ ph&acirc;n BODY theo <strong>m&ocirc;n thể thao</strong>, 1 đoạn cho c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n thể thao trở n&ecirc;n được y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch hơn v&agrave; 1 đoạn cho c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n thể thao c&ograve;n lại:\n<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CxTLdkLKloqH2WxhmM3lUbxDgLd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1: </strong>Tả số liệu v&agrave; thay đổi của <strong>Football, Swimming, v&agrave; Rugby</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VsopdBZyVo2xe6xbr6AlnVctgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Tả số liệu v&agrave; thay đổi của <strong>Snooker, Tennis, v&agrave; Golf</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-re